Diagram Legend:
- Entry Layer: User interaction and request routing
- Planning Layer: Task decomposition and planning
- Orchestration Layer: Agent coordination and delegation
- Specialized Agents: Domain-specific AI agents
- Tool Layer: Enterprise tool integration
- Knowledge Layer: Memory, knowledge, and context
- Governance Layer: Approvals, guardrails, and audit
- Observability: Metrics, tracing, and analytics